    ],
    "note": "<b>Thursday opens on the Nvidia report</b>, with jobless claims at 8:30am ET and the bond market back after the holiday. After Wednesday's close <b>Tetra Tech</b> rose about 8% after hours and <b>Corteva</b> fell about 7% on a weaker outlook. <b>Cisco</b> and <b>Applied Materials</b> report on Thursday, <b>PPI</b> comes on Friday and <b>Nvidia</b> on 17 November."
